WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Ryu falls from the corner medium-Blitz prerequisite.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.600
Standing medium punch reaches Ryu on recovery.

3
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.950
A second standing medium punch continues the conversion.

4
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.300
Heavy Psycho Uppercut catches the Chaser launch.

5
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.100
Ryu falls at the end of the conversion.
